<title>USA: Wilsons to sell $75 mln in snr notes.</title>
<headline>Wilsons to sell $75 mln in snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKLYN PARK, Minn. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wilsons The Leather Experts  Inc said Friday it planned to sell $75 million of senior notes due  2004 in a private offering.</p>
<p>Wilsons said it planned to use the net proceeds from the offering  to repurchase an outstanding 10 percent senior secured subordinated  note and for general corporate purposes, including capital expenditures  and additional store openings.</p>
<p>The offering was expected to be completed this month.</p>
<p>-- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
